        "TileImage": "$($repository e82d4acb-9ca6-45ba-b8ca-72b8c9fc75a4).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. A cabal of the wealthy elite known as The Ark Society are going to meet soon to mourn the death of their founder, and inagurate his replacements. The new leaders intend to change the organisation&apos;s course, while facing subtle but firm opposition by the other founding members. The five other founders are to be eliminated.\rTo minimise further controversy within the Society, the clients have requested the deaths to be framed as accidents.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
